                "text": "There's a lot of miniature houses over there, and we see over in a little corner of a neighborhood, sort of far away, there's a tree, and it's a tree with a little door in it and there's little windows and little pulleys and kites and all kinds of things of gnomish make, clever little contraptions and wonderful things and there, in the middle of the tree, standing up from a bed that fills up the entire tree at almost, sort of a slant, even, the face sort of pressed up against the windowsill, is Gorgug Thistlespring, Gorgug, can you tell us sort of what you look like and what you're doin' right now?",
                "delay": 57
